[00:18.72]1. Rejoice, give glory to Jehovah,
[00:23.72]For the heavens proclaim all his righteousness.
[00:28.72]Let us sing to our God joyful songs to his praise;
[00:33.72]Let us speak to all of his great acts.
[00:40.17](Chorus)
[00:46.84]Let the heavens rejoice, Let the earth joyful be,
[00:53.50]For Jehovah has become our King!
[01:26.97]Let the heavens rejoice, Let the earth joyful be,
[01:29.22]For Jehovah has become our King!
[01:31.47]2. His glory tell among the nations;
[01:33.72]For Jehovah to us is a God who saves.
[01:35.97]Yes, Jehovah is King; he deserves all the praise.
[01:41.97]So we bow before his mighty throne.
[01:48.48](Chorus)
[01:52.68]Let the heavens rejoice, Let the earth joyful be,
[01:56.88]For Jehovah has become our King!
[02:01.08]Let the heavens rejoice, Let the earth joyful be,
[02:05.28]For Jehovah has become our King!
[02:21.60]3. His righteous rule is now established.
[02:26.40]On his throne, he has placed his anointed Son.
[02:31.60]Let the gods of this world
[02:34.20]be brought down and be shamed,
[02:36.80]For the praise belongs to God alone.
[02:40.88](Chorus)
[02:44.97]Let the heavens rejoice, Let the earth joyful be,
[02:46.97]For Jehovah has become our King!
[02:54.97]Let the heavens rejoice, Let the earth joyful be,
[02:56.97]For Jehovah has become our King!